omo-tmux-dag
============

This package is a tmux port of omo-herdr-dag v1.3.1
(https://github.com/jc01rho/omo-herdr-dag), which is MIT licensed.

Adapted from that project (with permission of the MIT license):
  extension.mjs, src/controller.mjs, src/viewer.mjs, src/render.mjs,
  src/model.mjs, src/task-data.mjs, src/view-state.mjs, src/storage.mjs,
  src/i18n.mjs, src/runtime.mjs, scripts/install.mjs, scripts/build.mjs,
  bin/omo-tmux-dag.mjs, test fixtures.

Principal changes: the Herdr pane adapter (src/herdr.mjs) is replaced by a tmux
adapter (src/tmux.mjs); the activation guard reads $TMUX/$TMUX_PANE instead of
Herdr environment variables; the viewer closes its own pane with
`tmux kill-pane` and names its tmux pane `DAG · <session>`; installation targets
`~/.omo/agent/tmux-dag`.

The upstream license text is retained in LICENSE.upstream. This package is not
affiliated with or endorsed by the omo-herdr-dag maintainers.
